  "source": "derived from a live pair-device stanza and one live pair-success stanza received by this project's own unpaired session on 2026-11-15 (cmd/whatscore-probe). The pair-device indices are pinned by their structural position in <iq type=set id from><pair-device><ref>...</ref></pair-device></iq> and were reproduced across three runs. The pair-success indices are pinned by decoding one real 731-byte stanza with two independent decoders (this project's and the reference's), which agreed on every node, attribute and byte array; the account-identity HMAC in that stanza then verified against the adv secret of the QR that produced it. No token is recorded that was not present in an observed frame.",
